  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Before the community labs when you submitted your world for public release it got added to a database that you could see from a public link in the form of a spreadsheet.\n\nThis spreadsheet was very helpful in finding new worlds due to the fact that the new worlds category in game had limited slots and when a world leaves that list it is very hard to find it unless you are looking for it or its tags specifically.\n\nWhen the community labs was released and the publishing of worlds was automated this submission spreadsheet was ended.\n\nAs the worlds are now automatically made public from the community labs they could be added to a new spreadsheet when made public.  To stop the spreadsheet from growing ever larger limit the list to the last 250 worlds published publicly.\n\nIt could be a great help in making worlds discoverable as the last spreadsheet was helpful in that way.",
